2
City Council work session on February 25, 2020 
compared Arlington’s TP&M ordinance to other 
cities.  March 16, 2020 ETF focused on Cross 
Timbers preservation and enforcement measures.
Summary
Summary of Comparative Findings
Standards A: Residential: preserve 35% ci
Inventory: Oaks >3ci + Other >6ci
P: Oaks 3ci-5ci = x2
Nonresidential: 1:1
Inventory: Building pad >30ci; elsewhere >6ci
P&R: >3ci + 1.5 for Bonus trees (Oaks) and Significant Stand
Survey cities: ratios from 1.0 to 2.0 based on size or specimen
Enforcement A: Tree Preservation Plan (TPP)
Non-developmental: No ordinance but fee for tree removal 
Survey cities:  TPP + Tree Removal Permit (TRP) or blanket TRP
Best practices: * inventory survey * phantom-lined plans * inspections
Mitigation Fee Lowest of surveyed cities.  $100 vs. Avg of $175.
